Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and haste.
Equip {3}{R}{R}"""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=602658"^^xsd:anyURI ;
